2. Historical source documents do not inherit this license
----------------------------------------------------------

This license applies only to original content created for the CSIL History
Archive website and repository.

It does **not** apply to third-party historical documents, scans, manuals,
reports, correspondence, photographs, or other source files. Those materials
remain under their original copyright, Crown copyright, contractual, or
unknown-rights status.

Do not treat the presence of a file in this repository, or a citation on the
website, as permission to redistribute the underlying work.

See `documents/README.md` and `docs/copyright-policy.qmd` before adding any
source file.

3. Trademarks and names
-----------------------

Names of people, organizations, and government programs are used for
identification in a historical research context. This license does not grant
